{"slug":"/references/core_flows/Cart/Steps_Cart/functions/core_flows.Cart.Steps_Cart.getVariantPriceSetsStep","title":"getVariantPriceSetsStep","frontmatter":{},"toc":[{"title":"Example","id":"example","level":1},{"title":"Input","id":"getvariantpricesetsstep-input","level":4}],"blocks":[{"kind":"markdown","html":"This step retrieves the calculated price sets of the specified variants."},{"kind":"heading","level":1,"text":"Example","id":"example"},{"kind":"markdown","html":"To retrieve variant price sets with shared context:\n\n```ts\nconst data = getVariantPriceSetsStep({\n  variantIds: [\"variant_123\"],\n  context: { currency_code: \"usd\" }\n})\n```\n\nTo retrieve variant price sets with individual contexts:\n\n```ts\nconst data = getVariantPriceSetsStep({\n  data: [\n    { variantId: \"variant_123\", context: { currency_code: \"usd\" } },\n    { variantId: \"variant_456\", context: { currency_code: \"usd\" } }, // Same context - will be batched\n    { variantId: \"variant_789\", context: { currency_code: \"eur\" } }\n  ]\n})\n```"},{"kind":"heading","level":4,"text":"Input","id":"getvariantpricesetsstep-input"},{"kind":"typeList","sectionTitle":"getVariantPriceSetsStep","types":[{"name":"GetVariantPriceSetsStepInput \\| GetVariantPriceSetsStepBulkInput","type":"[GetVariantPriceSetsStepInput](/references/core_flows/core_core_flows_src/interfaces/core_flows.core_core_flows_src.GetVariantPriceSetsStepInput) \\| [GetVariantPriceSetsStepBulkInput](/references/core_flows/core_core_flows_src/interfaces/core_flows.core_core_flows_src.GetVariantPriceSetsStepBulkInput)","optional":false,"defaultValue":"","description":"","expandable":false,"children":[{"name":"GetVariantPriceSetsStepInput \\| GetVariantPriceSetsStepBulkInput","type":"[GetVariantPriceSetsStepInput](/references/core_flows/core_core_flows_src/interfaces/core_flows.core_core_flows_src.GetVariantPriceSetsStepInput) \\| [GetVariantPriceSetsStepBulkInput](/references/core_flows/core_core_flows_src/interfaces/co